<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tiffany started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tiffany started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it intiated coverage of Tiffany &amp; Co Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- said Tiffany's stock currently trades at 24 times Salomon's 1997 earnings per share estimate of $2.00, which is a premium to its 15 to 20 percent long-term earnings growth rate.</p>
<p>-- Tiffany lost 1/4 to 47-5/8.</p>
</text>
